{
  "Prefab": "entity/player_model_selector.prefab",
  "Title": "Player Model Selector",
  "Description": "Spawn one to give everyone a Custom Player Model tab in the C menu. Wear any rigged humanoid from the game, sbox.game or a mounted game, customize it and see its own arms in first person; everyone sees it. The host decides which models are allowed. It is invisible in the world: undo it or clean up to put everyone back to the citizen.",
